{"id":"n15020-1-7","stage":2,"title":"뒷문 · 后门","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15020-1-7-1","ko":"서울에서는 버스를 앞문으로 타.","zh":"在首尔要从前门上车。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"서울에서는","meaning":"首尔","explanation":"서울：首尔；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"서울에서는","audio":"/audio/3dfac1957b0bfc222ffe.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"버스를","meaning":"公共汽车，公交车","explanation":"버스：公共汽车，公交车；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"버스","audio":"/audio/fb84fa7f86eac62eca5f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36678","senseId":"1","lemma":"버스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"앞문으로","meaning":"前门","explanation":"앞문：前门；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"앞문","audio":"/audio/ab6ffd78dd27b1870d9e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16163","senseId":"1","lemma":"앞문","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"타.","meaning":"从事，经营","explanation":"하다：从事，经营；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"6","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"fb84fa7f86eac62e","term":"버스","zh":"公共汽车，公交车","audio":"/audio/fb84fa7f86eac62eca5f.mp3","entryId":"36678","definition":"收取费用、按照规定路线行驶、可乘坐多人的大汽车。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"ab6ffd78dd27b187","term":"앞문","zh":"前门","audio":"/audio/ab6ffd78dd27b1870d9e.mp3","entryId":"16163","definition":"位于房间或建筑前部的门。","pronunciation":["암문"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"从事，经营","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"拥有某种职业或运营某种事业。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/46c7633e47d4cee2d5ab.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15020-1-7-2","ko":"그래? 우리 고향에서는 뒷문으로 버스를 타는데.","zh":"是吗？我们老家是往后门上车的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래?","meaning":"好吧，是","explanation":"그래：好吧，是","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"고향에서는","meaning":"故乡，家乡","explanation":"고향：故乡，家乡；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"고향","audio":"/audio/998538467e18fc3a541b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27364","senseId":"1","lemma":"고향","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뒷문으로","meaning":"后门","explanation":"뒷문：后门；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"뒷문","audio":"/audio/c58b0c94d24ac2be56e7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15020","senseId":"1","lemma":"뒷문","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"버스를","meaning":"公共汽车，公交车","explanation":"버스：公共汽车，公交车；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"버스","audio":"/audio/fb84fa7f86eac62eca5f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36678","senseId":"1","lemma":"버스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"타는데.","meaning":"乘，乘坐","explanation":"타다：乘，乘坐；는데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"타다","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17160","senseId":"1","lemma":"타다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d39087dda3899d88","term":"그래","zh":"好吧，是","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3","entryId":"27656","definition":"用于回答，表示“会那样做，是那样的，知道了”等肯定的含义。","pronunciation":["그래"]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"998538467e18fc3a","term":"고향","zh":"故乡，家乡","audio":"/audio/998538467e18fc3a541b.mp3","entryId":"27364","definition":"出生成长的地方。","pronunciation":["고향"]},{"id":"c58b0c94d24ac2be","term":"뒷문","zh":"后门","audio":"/audio/c58b0c94d24ac2be56e7.mp3","entryId":"15020","definition":"房间或建筑后面的门。","pronunciation":["뒨ː문"]},{"id":"fb84fa7f86eac62e","te